text:
My apologies for the previous error. I used an incorrect ID for the "Reading & Labs (Core Engineering)" block, which is why the proposal failed. Thank you for pointing it out.

I've prepared a new proposal for you, making sure to use the correct block IDs this time.

Here's what it will do:
- First, it will create a new goal called "Learning & Skill Development" for you to track your growth.
- Then, it will remove your existing "Reading & Labs (Core Engineering)" blocks on both Tuesday and Thursday (7:00 AM to 9:00 AM).
- Finally, it will add the new "Soft Skills" and "Tech Labs" blocks on both Tuesday and Thursday, running from 7:00 AM to 7:30 AM and 7:30 AM to 8:00 AM respectively, linking them to your new "Learning & Skill Development" goal.

This change will also free up the 8:00 AM to 9:00 AM slot on both Tuesday and Thursday mornings.

```coach-proposal
{
  "summary": "Create 'Learning & Skill Development' goal, then replace Tue/Thu 'Reading & Labs (Core Engineering)' with 'Soft Skills' and 'Tech Labs', linked to the new goal.",
  "actions": [
    {
      "type": "CREATE_GOAL",
      "payload": {
        "title": "Learning & Skill Development",
        "category": "LEARNING",
        "targetHours": 4,
        "description": "Focused time on engineering skills and soft skills for career growth."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "DELETE_SCHEDULE_BLOCK",
      "id": "1a78bae8-7aac-4d57-abe1-53f3aa8ede25",
      "expectedTitle": "Reading & Labs (Core Engineering)"
    },
    {
      "type": "DELETE_SCHEDULE_BLOCK",
      "id": "cb23ea40-056b-41d7-a0dc-94a9eaab4252",
      "expectedTitle": "Reading & Labs (Core Engineering)"
    },
    {
      "type": "CREATE_SCHEDULE_BLOCK",
      "payload": {
        "title": "Soft Skills",
        "startTime": "07:00",
        "endTime": "07:30",
        "daysOfWeek": [2, 4],
        "category": "LEARNING",
        "goalId": "$ref:0"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "CREATE_SCHEDULE_BLOCK",
      "payload": {
        "title": "Tech Labs",
        "startTime": "07:30",
        "endTime": "08:00",
        "daysOfWeek": [2, 4],
        "category": "LEARNING",
        "goalId": "$ref:0"
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

I noticed many of your current schedule blocks, like "Morning Prayer", "Family Time", and "Work", are not linked to any goals. Would you like me to help you create goals for them so you can track your time towards your "why" of growing as an engineer without losing time with family and community?
